nd crews</blockquote></div><div class='empty'><span class='source-check-badge source-check-none'>No quote to check</span> No verified source passage.</div></article><footer>Single-pass Muse Spark analysis via Meta Model API · Model muse-spark-1.3 · Created 2026-10-30T09:10:21+00:00 UTC<br>CV SHA-256: ec87b932018d176a9b7fbb8eb846974f1f116980270529d227edad3831448e4b<br>Job description SHA-256: 4674af57adde5ef3164e43081dac8a2ac6fb47fa2f8bfef0658e9cff14f2321b<br>Page-labelled CV text and job criteria from the job description are sent to Meta Model API for this analysis. The original PDF is used locally for quote and page verification. EvidenceTrail does not write uploaded files to persistent application storage; temporary handling depends on the request runtime. This report embeds CV page images; review it before sharing.</footer></main></body></html>",
